{"title":"Freeze Dried Fruit","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"black-jamun-freeze-dried-fruit-chips","title":"Freeze Dried Jamun","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience the bold, tangy goodness of \u003cstrong\u003eBlack Jamun\u003c\/strong\u003e in a light, crunchy form. Our freeze-dried jamun\u003cbr\u003echips are made from carefully selected ripe fruits and processed using advanced freeze-drying\u003cbr\u003etechnology to retain their natural colour, flavour, and nutrients.\u003cbr\u003ePerfect as a guilt-free snack, these chips are 100% fruit, with no added sugar, preservatives, or\u003cbr\u003eartificial flavours. Enjoy them straight from the pack or add them to smoothies, yoghurt, or breakfast\u003cbr\u003ebowls.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"food123.ai","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44543559893103,"sku":null,"price":2.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0702\/9984\/4719\/files\/jamun.png?v=1771411053"},{"product_id":"mango-freeze-dried-fruit-chunks","title":"Freeze Dried Mango","description":"\u003cp\u003eEnjoy the rich, tropical sweetness of mangoes all year round with our \u003cstrong\u003eFreeze-Dried Mango Fruit\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChunks\u003c\/strong\u003e. Made from ripe, juicy mangoes, these chunks deliver intense flavour with a light, crispy\u003cbr\u003etexture.\u003cbr\u003eFreeze-drying helps preserve the fruit’s natural taste and nutrients without the need for additives. A\u003cbr\u003eperfect snack for mango lovers, whether you’re at home, at work, or on the go.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"food123.ai","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":52740378558575,"sku":null,"price":2.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0702\/9984\/4719\/files\/mango.png?v=1772087823"},{"product_id":"pink-guava-freeze-dried-fruit-chunks","title":"Freeze Dried Pink Guava","description":"\u003cp\u003eOur \u003cstrong\u003ePink Guava Freeze-Dried Fruit Chunks\u003c\/strong\u003e capture the refreshing, mildly sweet taste of fresh guava\u003cbr\u003ein a crunchy bite. Made using premium pink guavas, these chunks are freeze-dried to lock in flavour,\u003cbr\u003ecolour, and nutrition.\u003cbr\u003eA wholesome snack choice that fits perfectly into an active and health-conscious lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"food123.ai","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":52740381999215,"sku":null,"price":2.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0702\/9984\/4719\/files\/pink.png?v=1772088192"},{"product_id":"sapota-freeze-dried-fruit-chips","title":"Freeze Dried Chikoo","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"woocommerce-product-details__short-description\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"276\"\u003e✔ No Added Sugar\u003cbr\u003e✔ 100% Natural\u003cbr\u003e✔ Kid Friendly\u003cbr\u003e✔ Free Shipping Above ₹1000\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"food123.ai","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":52740383834223,"sku":null,"price":2.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0702\/9984\/4719\/files\/sapota.png?v=1772088447"},{"product_id":"strawberry-freeze-dried-fruit-chips","title":"Freeze Dried Strawberry","description":"\u003cp\u003eBright, tangy, and irresistibly crunchy — our \u003cstrong\u003eFreeze-Dried Strawberry Fruit Chips\u003c\/strong\u003e are made from\u003cbr\u003efresh strawberries, freeze-dried to preserve their vibrant colour and natural taste.\u003cbr\u003eThese chips are perfect for snacking, baking, or adding a fruity crunch to smoothies and desserts.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"food123.ai","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":52740384850031,"sku":null,"price":2.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0702\/9984\/4719\/files\/strawbeery.png?v=1772088629"}],"thumbna